sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant App as Employee Portal
    participant API as Sensitive API
    participant Vault as Key Vault
    participant SIEM as Sentinel

    User->>App: Request protected resource
    App->>Entra: OIDC authentication request
    Entra->>Entra: MFA + Conditional Access
    Entra-->>App: Signed identity/access token
    App->>API: Token + client certificate
    API->>API: Validate token, role, certificate
    API->>Vault: Managed identity token request
    Vault-->>API: Authorised secret only
    API-->>User: Protected response
    Entra-->>SIEM: Sign-in/audit logs
    API-->>SIEM: Auth and access events
    Vault-->>SIEM: Diagnostic logs
